Allure is a popular test reporting framework that provides detailed and visually appealing reports for automated tests. To generate Allure reports for your Playwright tests, you can follow these steps:
-> npm install allure-commandline --save-dev
-> allure generate allure-results --clean -o allure-report
-> allure open ./allure-report

Run the test cases after configure in package.json file with the command "npm test" and then execute the above commands to generate and open the Allure report.
-> npm run test:master:headed